    <el-dialog :title="approvalDialogTitle" :visible.sync="approvalDialogVisible" width="520px"><el-form label-width="130px" size="small"><el-form-item label="当前审批节点"><span>{{ accident.currentNode }}</span></el-form-item><el-form-item v-if="accident.currentNode === '人力资源部审批'" label="工伤保险办理人员"><el-select v-model="approvalHandler" filterable placeholder="请选择办理人员" style="width:100%"><el-option v-for="item in insuranceHandlers" :key="item" :label="item" :value="item"/></el-select></el-form-item><el-form-item label="审批说明"><el-input v-model="approvalComment" type="textarea" :rows="3" placeholder="请输入审批说明（选填）"/></el-form-item></el-form><p class="dialog-note"><i class="el-icon-info"></i> 点击确认后还需进行二次确认，审批结果将更新到本事故流程。</p><span slot="footer"><el-button @click="approvalDialogVisible = false">取消</el-button><el-button type="primary" @click="confirmApproval">确认审批</el-button></span></el-dialog>
